      "unlockDate" : 759452400,
      "ingredients" : "For the Dish:\n\t•\t400 g soft tofu (silken or medium-firm), cut into 1-inch cubes\n\t•\t200 g ground pork or beef\n\t•\t2 tablespoons vegetable oil\n\t•\t2 tablespoons doubanjiang (Sichuan chili bean paste)\n\t•\t1 tablespoon fermented black beans (optional, rinsed and chopped)\n\t•\t2 garlic cloves, minced\n\t•\t1 teaspoon ginger, minced\n\t•\t1 teaspoon Sichuan peppercorns (optional, crushed or whole)\n\t•\t1 teaspoon chili flakes (optional, for extra heat)\n\t•\t1 cup chicken or vegetable stock\n\t•\t2 teaspoons soy sauce\n\t•\t1 teaspoon sugar\n\t•\t1 teaspoon sesame oil (optional, for flavor)\n\t•\t2 tablespoons cornstarch mixed with 3 tablespoons water (for slurry)\n\nFor Garnish:\n\t•\t2 green onions, thinly sliced\n\t•\tA pinch of ground Sichuan peppercorns (optional)\n",
      "id" : "1F48A454-C789-4276-998C-86BD5907275B"
